+# Squashfs test images
+
+`symlinks.sqfs` contains this tree (regular file contents are in quotes):
+
+```text
+src/
+  file.txt              "hello"
+  regular.rclonelink    "ordinary"
+  link.txt           -> file.txt
+  dirlink            -> .
+  dangling           -> missing
+  absolute           -> /absolute
+  link.rclonelink     -> file.txt
+```
+
+All modification times are 1700000000. It can be generated from a directory
+`tree` containing the above `src` directory with:
+
+```sh
+mksquashfs tree symlinks.sqfs -noappend -all-time 1700000000 -no-xattrs
+```
