 For `zip` and `squashfs` files this is 1s.
 
+## Symbolic links
+
+Symbolic links in ZIP and Squashfs archives are skipped by default. Use
+`-l`/`--links` to expose them as files with a `.rclonelink` suffix whose
+contents are the link target. Links are not followed within the archive.
+
+To recreate symbolic links when copying to a destination that supports them, use
+`--links`:
+
+```sh
+rclone copy --links :archive:/tmp/test.zip /tmp/out
+```
+
 ## Hashes
 
 Which hash is supported depends on the archive type. Zip files use
